{"parse": {"title": "3RD-01", "pageid": 6065, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/2ND-15\" title=\"2ND-15\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">3RD-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/3RD-02\" title=\"3RD-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">3RD</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.BF.A6.E5.8B.92.E5.BA.95.E7.A5.9E.E8.B0.95\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"迦勒底神谕\">迦勒底神谕</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 迦勒底神谕</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Chaldean Oracles</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>举<span class=\"color-value\"></span>手<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span>回<span class=\"color-value\"></span>答<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span>漂<span class=\"color-value\"></span>亮<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>徽<span class=\"color-value\"></span>章<span class=\"color-value\"></span>将<span class=\"color-value\"></span>被<span class=\"color-value\"></span>赠<span class=\"color-value\"></span>与<span class=\"color-value\"></span>最<span class=\"color-value\"></span>出<span class=\"color-value\"></span>色<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>孩<span class=\"color-value\"></span>子<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 10301</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>神秘学家更注重的是另一进路的知识，我们通常将它称为灵知。与人类的理性相比，灵知的特征分别是什么？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-diyifangxianxuexiao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"diyifangxianxuexiao\"><img alt=\"diyifangxianxuexiao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-diyifangxianxuexiao.png/600px-Cg-diyifangxianxuexiao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-diyifangxianxuexiao.png/900px-Cg-diyifangxianxuexiao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-diyifangxianxuexiao.png/1200px-Cg-diyifangxianxuexiao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>十四行诗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>报告教员，灵知的特征是：一不能被独立验证；二不具备理性交流的可能。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>没错。这也是神秘学的知识难以被大众学术界认可的原因之一。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>学术研究要求“公开”且可被独立检验，但神秘学的不确定性会让专业研究落入“方法上的不可知论”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>而学校给你们提供的训练与科学矫正器械支持，就是为了让大家的不确定性变得更为可控，以保证人类世界的和平与稳定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生众：</div><div>愿和平与我们同在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/HeadIconSmall-506510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/HeadIconSmall-506510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/HeadIconSmall-506510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/HeadIconSmall-506510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/HeadIconSmall-506510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/HeadIconSmall-506510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>呜……差点就抢答成功了。她的速度怎么这么快啊……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>下一题。罗马帝国衰落后，神秘学家的数量与研究文献也相应减少。有谁能简述一下当时的历史？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-506501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-506501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-506501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我——我——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>我——教员，这题我知道——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-506501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-506501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-506501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>十四行诗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-506501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-506501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-506501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>呜哇……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>罗马帝国衰落后，神秘学家受到天性中缺乏理性一面的诱惑，将神秘术中的自然魔法用于利益争夺和战争中，逐渐引起主流宗教的不满。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>当时的欧洲普遍认为神秘术是一种“与恶魔接触”的异教崇拜行为，进而发动了一系列对神秘学家的审判。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>对此，神秘学界也展开了猛烈的反攻。但由于他们自身行踪不定，战术交流不畅……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>经过数个阶段的战况反复，最终以宗教界和世俗界为代表的人类取得了胜利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-506501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-506501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-506501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……咦？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-506501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-506501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-506501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>不对……这跟爷爷当时说的不一样……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-506501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-506501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-506501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>教员！她说的不对，我知道——我知道正确答案！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>好。你说说看，玛蒂尔达。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-507301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-507301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-507301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>就我所知道的呢，神秘学家并没有主动发起战争！当时的西欧各领主是为了争夺资源、神秘学研究文献才去攻占君士坦丁堡的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-507301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-507301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-507301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>我爷爷唱给我的童谣里记录了这一切的真相！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-507301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-507301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-507301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>而且，很久以前，神秘学家根本不叫神秘学家……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-507301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-507301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-507301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>他们曾经是很有天赋的哲学家、占卜师、医生……后来，却被钉上“异教徒”、“怪胎”、“女巫”的标签，被驱赶到社会的边缘，离群索居……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-507301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-507301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-507301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>所有人都忘了他们。人们再次见到他们的时候，他们就有了新的名字——神秘学家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>很有启发性的观点。你还记得这首童谣的名字吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-507301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-507301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-507301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>啊，爷爷从没跟我提过它的名字……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-507301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-507301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-507301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>那么旋律呢？你能为我们哼唱一段吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-507301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-507301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-507301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>我想想，应该是……哼哼♪……嗯——不对。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-507301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-507301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-507301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>奇怪？我、我好像也不记得了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-504501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-504501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-504501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">同学Ⅰ：</div><div>嘻嘻……你什么都不记得，怎么还好意思站起来回答问题啊，小不点！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-507301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-507301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-507301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>我昨天晚上还哼过这首歌！只是——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>先坐下吧，玛蒂尔达。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>十四行诗的回答是正确的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>玛蒂尔达，你刚刚转学过来，还需要一段时间来适应我们的课程。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>童谣可以作为民间文学的研究材料，但它与正式的历史情报仍有很大的不同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/HeadIconSmall-506510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/HeadIconSmall-506510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/HeadIconSmall-506510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>同学们，翻到试卷的最后一题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>君士坦丁堡被奥斯曼帝国攻克后，我们的沙兰公社成员，罗马帝国神秘学家、哲学家乔治·盖弥斯托斯来到了佛罗伦萨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>他带来了古代通神术的经典著作。正是这部作品开启了佛罗伦萨人文学者每年一聚，探讨如何将神秘学运用于人类发展的“迦勒底会议”的历史。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>有哪位同学知道这部著作的名称？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>教员——请让我来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-507301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-507301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-507301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>教员，让我来，这题、我真的知道——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的视线落到十四行诗身旁。那张书桌上垒着高高的书墙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>维尔汀，你知道这个问题的答案吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>维尔汀？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>教员走下讲台。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>……维尔汀，今天又没来上课吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-506501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-506501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-506501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>教员——我知道答案——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-506501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-506501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-506501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>是《迦勒底神谕》！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "3RD-01"}}